# ==================== FreeMap Trinetra Environment Config ====================
#
# This project is designed to work entirely without external map tile APIs.
# The default mode uses bundled Natural Earth GeoJSON (public domain) —
# zero external requests, no API key, no tile quota, no third-party uptime dependency.
# See LocalBasemap.tsx for the "local" basemap details.
#
# To use raster tiles instead, set VITE_MAP_TILE_URL to a self-hosted or public tile server.
# The map will automatically fall back to the local basemap if this is empty.
#
# =============================================================================
# Map: Basemap / Tile Layer
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default (empty): Bundled Natural Earth GeoJSON — completely free, no key needed.
# Set below to enable tile layers. Supports any {s}, {z}, {x}, {y} template vars.
#
# Recommended free-for-life option (no login required, attribution only):
#   VITE_MAP_TILE_URL="https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png"
#
# Other options:
#   • Mapbox: requires account & API key (free tier available but needs signup)
#   • Thunderforest: requires API key (free tier, needs registration)
#   • Self-hosted: e.g. http://localhost:8080/tile/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
#
# =============================================================================
# ThreatFox (malware IOC feed) — free Auth-Key from https://auth.abuse.ch
# Required for keyed ThreatFox feed; without it, Feodo + IPsum feeds only.
# Get a free key at: https://auth.abuse.ch/register
# VITE_THREATFOX_AUTH_KEY="your-auth-key-here"
#
# =============================================================================
# App general (keep as-is unless you know what you're changing)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEBUG=false
# PLUGIN_TIMEOUT=60000
# CACHE_TTL_DEFAULT=300
# CACHE_TTL_LONG=86400
# APP_NAME=trinetra
# VERSION=0.1.0